  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사를\n카나리인형과 교환해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C000ACE74B098B9ACC778D615ACFC0020AD50D658D5740020C904AC8C002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사를 가져오면\n카나리인형과 교환해 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C0020AC00C838C624BA74000ACE74B098B9ACC778D615ACFC0020AD50D658D5740020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "교환한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD50D658D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빨강카나리인형이 있으면\n경험치가 불어난다는 소문이 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE68AC15CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020C788C73CBA74000AACBDD5D8CE58AC000020BD88C5B4B09CB2E4B2940020C18CBB38C7740020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "금색카나리인형이 있으면\n돈이 불어난다는 소문이 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE08C0C9CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020C788C73CBA74000AB3C8C7740020BD88C5B4B09CB2E4B2940020C18CBB38C7740020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "분홍카나리인형이 있으면\n메가조각이 불어난다는 소문이 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD84D64DCE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020C788C73CBA74000ABA54AC00C870AC01C7740020BD88C5B4B09CB2E4B2940020C18CBB38C7740020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "초록카나리인형이 있으면\n포켓몬의 기술을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n잘 버티게 해 준다는 소문이 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD08B85DCE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020C788C73CBA74000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220C74400100001BE00000AC7980020BC84D2F0AC8C0020D5740020C900B2E4B2940020C18CBB38C7740020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파랑카나리인형이 있으면\n포켓몬이 잘 잡힌다는 소문이 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB791CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020C788C73CBA74000AD3ECCF13BAACC7740020C7980020C7A1D78CB2E4B2940020C18CBB38C7740020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "교환 때문이 아니면\n여긴 대체 뭐 하러 온 거야?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD50D6580020B54CBB38C7740020C544B2C8BA74000AC5ECAE340020B300CCB40020BB500020D558B7EC0020C6280020AC70C57C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와우! 모든 종류의\n카나리인형을 손에 넣었구나!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그런 너에게 좋은 정보를 가르쳐 줄게!\n남은 컬러풀한나사를 모두 가져오면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n대왕 카나리인형을 선물로 받을 수 있어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사는\n앞으로 <U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004>개가 남았어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n남은 컬러풀한나사를 모두 가져오면\n대왕 카나리인형을 선물로 줄게!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB294000AC55EC73CB85C00200010000202010004AC1CAC000020B0A8C558C5B4002E00100001BE01000AB0A8C7400020CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C0020BAA8B4500020AC00C838C624BA74000AB300C6550020CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7440020C120BB3CB85C0020C904AC8C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사를 전부 가져왔구나!\n약속대로 대왕 카나리인형을 선물로 줄게!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n숙소로 보냈으니까 확인해 봐!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C0020C804BD800020AC00C838C654AD6CB0980021000AC57DC18DB300B85C0020B300C6550020CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7440020C120BB3CB85C0020C904AC8C002100100001BE00000AC219C18CB85C0020BCF4B0C8C73CB2C8AE4C0020D655C778D5740020BD1000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호텔Z 객실에\n대왕 카나리인형이 배송되었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638D154005A0020AC1DC2E4C5D0000AB300C6550020CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7740020BC30C1A1B418C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모든 카나리인형을 손에 넣었으니\n이제 여기에 볼일은 없지 않아?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B4E00020CE74B098B9ACC778D615C7440020C190C5D00020B123C5C8C73CB2C8000AC774C81C0020C5ECAE30C5D00020BCFCC77CC7400020C5C6C9C00020C54AC544003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사를 모으면\n또 오도록 해.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB97C0020BAA8C73CBA74000AB6100020C624B3C4B85D0020D574002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어마어마한 양의 카나리 굿즈다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B9C8C5B4B9C8D55C0020C591C7580020CE74B098B9AC0020AD7FC988B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저리더프와 포켓몬들의 봉제인형이 있다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B9ACB354D504C6400020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020BD09C81CC778D615C7740020C788B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부도 게임도 좋단 말이지.\n어린이도 어른을 이기면 칭찬받을 수 있잖아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B3C40020AC8CC784B3C40020C88BB2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E000AC5B4B9B0C774B3C40020C5B4B978C7440020C774AE30BA740020CE6DCC2CBC1BC7440020C2180020C788C796C544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "견적은 확실히 해야 하니까\n구두 계약으로 끝낼 생각 말라고!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACACC801C7400020D655C2E4D7880020D574C57C0020D558B2C8AE4C000AAD6CB4500020ACC4C57DC73CB85C0020B05DB0BC0020C0DDAC010020B9D0B77CACE000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나사를 컬러풀하게 만드는 작업은\n의외로 상당한 테크닉을 요구한다고.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C0ACB97C0020CEECB7ECD480D558AC8C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020C791C5C5C740000AC758C678B85C0020C0C1B2F9D55C0020D14CD06CB2C9C7440020C694AD6CD55CB2E4ACE0002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비계로 코스를 만드는 것은\n미르 사람들을 즐겁게 하기 위함이라네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44ACC4B85C0020CF54C2A4B97C0020B9CCB4DCB2940020AC83C740000ABBF8B9740020C0ACB78CB4E4C7440020C990AC81AC8C0020D558AE300020C704D568C774B77CB124002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 컬트 퀴즈왕이라면\n홀로그램 카나리도 잘 연기할 수 있겠군!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020CEECD2B80020D034C988C655C774B77CBA74000AD640B85CADF8B7A80020CE74B098B9ACB3C40020C7980020C5F0AE30D5600020C2180020C788ACA0AD70002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이상한 팬들로부터 손녀를 지키기 위해\n홀로그램 카나리를 연기하기 시작했는데...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n연기를 하다 보니 어느새 즐기게 되더군!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컬러풀한나사는\n내 나름대로 재미를 위해 고안한 거라네!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n즐거운 추억이 생기면\n도시를 더 사랑하게 되지 않겠나.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEECB7ECD480D55CB098C0ACB294000AB0B40020B098B984B300B85C0020C7ACBBF8B97C0020C704D5740020ACE0C548D55C0020AC70B77CB124002100100001BE01000AC990AC70C6B40020CD94C5B5C7740020C0DDAE30BA74000AB3C4C2DCB97C0020B3540020C0ACB791D558AC8C0020B418C9C00020C54AACA0B098002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째 큰 일거리가 생길 것 같군!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F80020D0700020C77CAC70B9ACAC000020C0DDAE380020AC830020AC19AD70002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전 세계에 비계 코스...가 아니라\n카나리의 매력을 전하고 싶군.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8040020C138ACC4C5D00020BE44ACC40020CF54C2A4002E002E002EAC000020C544B2C8B77C000ACE74B098B9ACC7580020B9E4B825C7440020C804D558ACE00020C2F6AD70002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "할아버지의 홀로그램 카나리에\n기뻐하는 팬이 있다니... 조금 심란하네...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D560C544BC84C9C0C7580020D640B85CADF8B7A80020CE74B098B9ACC5D0000AAE30BED0D558B2940020D32CC7740020C788B2E4B2C8002E002E002E0020C870AE080020C2ECB780D558B124002E002E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무쿠는 혼자서 다\n떠안으려 하는 타입이란 말이지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34CFE0B2940020D63CC790C11C0020B2E4000AB5A0C548C73CB8240020D558B2940020D0C0C785C774B7800020B9D0C774C9C0002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너... 스트리머의 모니터를 훔쳐보는 건\n매너 위반이라고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002E002E002E0020C2A4D2B8B9ACBA38C7580020BAA8B2C8D130B97C0020D6D4CCD0BCF4B2940020AC74000AB9E4B1080020C704BC18C774B77CACE0002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프리즘타워를 방치해 뒀다간\n미르 사람들이 더는 웃을 수 없게 될 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B9ACC998D0C0C6CCB97C0020BC29CE58D5740020B480B2E4AC04000ABBF8B9740020C0ACB78CB4E4C7740020B354B2940020C6C3C7440020C2180020C5C6AC8C0020B4200020AC70C57C002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZZ4와 함께\n미르를 즐거운 곳으로 만들고 싶어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A005A0034C6400020D568AED8000ABBF8B974B97C0020C990AC70C6B40020ACF3C73CB85C0020B9CCB4E4ACE00020C2F6C5B4002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    }
  ],
